; Eight whole years, and only the last five feed the medians. The
; five that count carry the same shape — an ordinary month, a
; heavier July, a much heavier December — while 2018 through 2022
; sit an order of magnitude below it: a life at a different level,
; which is what a long ledger actually holds. December 2017 opens
; the ledger and is left out, because a ledger's first month is
; rarely a whole one.
option "title" "Season"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

